      "field": "abstract",
      "raw_text": "Attribute-based encryption (ABE) enables fine-grained access con- trol on encrypted data and has a large number of practical applica- tions. This paper presents FABEO: faster pairing-based ciphertext- policy and key-policy ABE schemes that support expressive policies and put no restriction on policy type or attributes, and the first to achieve optimal, adaptive security with multiple challenge ci- phertexts. We implement our schemes and demonstrate that they perform better than the state-of-the-art (Bethencourt et al. S&P all parameters of practical interest.",
